<div class="container narrow policy-copy section"><h2>Your sample inquiry</h2><p>The inquiry controls are a demonstration. They do not send email, create bookings, take payments or save your entries. Reviewing a form only checks the fields in your browser. Please avoid entering sensitive or real personal information.</p><h2>Assets and links</h2><p>Fonts, photographs, styles and scripts are served locally by the theme. The theme adds no analytics, trackers or third-party scripts. Photographer credit links take you to the named external source, whose own policies apply.</p><h2>A live WordPress installation</h2><p>A hosting provider or WordPress installation may process technical requests, logs and login cookies independently of this theme. The site operator must describe its actual hosting, plugins, retention and contact arrangements before using this design for a real studio.</p><h2>Questions about the demonstration</h2><p>See the <a href="<?php echo clay_url( '/contact/' ); ?>">studio inquiry page</a> for the scope of this sample, or <a href="<?php echo clay_url(); ?>">return home</a>.</p></div>
